Third-party components and data
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository does not bundle model weights or third-party source code.
The following are downloaded by scripts and are subject to their own licenses.

1. openai/privacy-filter (model weights and the "opf" reference code)
   https://huggingface.co/openai/privacy-filter
   https://github.com/openai/privacy-filter
   License: Apache License 2.0

2. sumeshi/privacy-filter-jp-GGUF (Japanese fine-tuned model, GGUF)
   https://huggingface.co/sumeshi/privacy-filter-jp-GGUF
   License: Apache License 2.0

3. sumeshi/privacy-filter-jp.cpp (GGUF inference runtime, with ggml)
   https://github.com/sumeshi/privacy-filter-jp.cpp
   License: MIT License (ggml: MIT License)
   env/patches/*.patch are small modifications to this project and are
   provided under the same MIT License.

The following data is included in this repository:

4. data/public_bench/sumeshi_*.jsonl
   Converted (format only) from the benchmark files in
   sumeshi/privacy-filter-jp.cpp (datasets/benchmark/), MIT License,
   Copyright (c) 2026 the privacy-filter.cpp authors. Used for diagnostics only.

